      "agent_input": "Please open the current Q3 business report located at docs/q3_report.md so I can review the results.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here's the **Meridian Analytics Q3 2026 Business Report** for your review:\n\n---\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nQ3 2026 marks another strong quarter. Across the 15-person team, **14 deals out of 22 opportunities** were closed, generating **$1,040,000** in new contract value. The sales pipeline remains healthy with several high-value deals still pending, and all critical support issues were resolved same-day.\n\n---\n\n## Sales Performance\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Total Closed Revenue** | $1,040,000 |\n| **Top Region** | South \u2014 $468,000 in won deals |\n| **Active Opportunities** | 22 |\n| **Win Rate** | 63.6% (above the 55% target) |\n| **Pending Deals** | ~$240,000 (3 deals expected to close by end of Sept) |\n\nThe field sales team (James Okafor, Sofia Delgado, Marcus Webb) drove results, with product mix shifting toward **Meridian Insights Pro**. **Meridian DataBridge** continues as a strong land-and-expand vehicle with upsell opportunities maturing in Q4.\n\n---\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n- \ud83c\udfc6 **Top Deal:** Sofia Delgado closed a **$198,000** Meridian Insights Pro contract (D019) on September 5.\n- \ud83d\udc65 **Headcount:** 15 employees across Sales (4), Engineering (5), Product (3), HR (1), Finance (2).\n- \u2705 **Support SLA:** All critical tickets (TKT-004, TKT-011, TKT-015) resolved within 24 hours.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **License Utilization:** SKU-001 (Insights Pro) at **94% capacity** \u2014 procurement review scheduled for October.\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Close pending deals (D007, D013, D020, D022) before Q3 end.\n2. Begin Q4 pipeline review \u2014 target **$1.2M** in new ARR.\n3. Resolve open support tickets (TKT-013, TKT-016, TKT-019) ahead of quarterly customer success calls.\n4. Conduct license capacity review for SKU-001 and SKU-003 in early October.\n5. HR to initiate two new engineering hire approvals with Kenji Obi for Q4 roadmap support.\n\n---\n\nThe report is prepared by **Rachel Kim** (VP of Sales) and **Claire Fontaine** (CFO), covering the period July 1 \u2013 September 7, 2026. Let me know if you'd like to dig deeper into any section!",
        "status_code": null
      },
